paint (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release:
    - Add native OpenRaster (.ora) multi-layer import/export and Export dialog
    - Add Alpha Lock, Layer Lock, drag reorder, Solo Layer, Copy Merged, and Import as Layer
    - Add Ellipse/Lasso/Wand selections, Invert Selection, Tolerance Fill, Gradient, and Blur/Pixelate
    - Add stylus pressure/eraser routing, direct multiline Text, and dual swatches with Custom Palette
    - Add live-preview filters, Trim Transparent, top-left coords HUD, edge resize preview, and Print
    - Modularize codebase with 256 MB memory-budgeted undo and atomic 30s autosave

 -- spondle <noreply@example.invalid>  Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:45:00 -0500

paint (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release:
    - Add multi-layer support, blend modes, and collapsible Layers sidebar
    - Add Selection, Text, Eyedropper, Resize & Scale, Rotate/Flip, and Pixel Grid
    - Add brush styles, Recent Colors, Block Arrow shape, and Spacebar repositioning
    - Add customizable keyboard shortcuts and startup window/canvas sizing preferences

