paint (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release:
    - Add full transparency support for PNG and WebP images
    - Add Transparency tool (Brush, Fill, and Clear to Transparent)
    - Add Line tool and Shapes tool with outline/filled modes
    - Add Clear Canvas button to the floating toolbar
    - Add Debian packaging

